# On Sabbatical (crystalWar 32), the available rivals at Gentle Tiger: a level 99 Warrior in Bastok Markets [S] with On
# Sabbatical accepted at Prog 1 (a GM: 47, a Progress) and the WotG mission Adieu, Lilisette current, Back to the
# Beginning completed (GMs). Each Bastok quest in turn is made available by completing the one before it (GMs): its
# offer (a Progress) ties with 47 and the lookup rotates them, 47 first and then the offer: Honor under Fire 66, Beneath
# the Mask 345, What Price Loyalty 348, The Truth Lies Hid 211, Light in the Darkness 16 (Fires of Discontent
# completed) and Burden of Suspicion 30. Each offer, finished, begins its quest, which then answers with an Event.
lists BastokMarketsS/Gentle_Tiger/onTrigger BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/66 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/345 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/348 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/211 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/16 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/30
char zone=BastokMarketsS pos=-202.432,-9.998,2.237 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning completed
mission Wotg AdieuLilisette current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
quest CrystalWar.OnSabbatical accepted          # a GM
charvar Quest[7][32]Prog 1                      # a GM: 47
quest CrystalWar.QuellingTheStorm completed # a GM: HonorUnderFire available
trigger Gentle_Tiger                            # 47 first
finish
trigger Gentle_Tiger                            # the offer
finish
quest CrystalWar.HonorUnderFire completed # a GM: BeneathTheMask available
trigger Gentle_Tiger                            # 47 first
finish
trigger Gentle_Tiger                            # the offer
finish
